<title>UK: IGC monthly data to be issued Friday.</title>
<headline>IGC monthly data to be issued Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The monthly world grain crop update issued by the International Grains Council (IGC) will be released on Friday, August 30.</p>
<p>The data is usually issued on the last Thursday of each month but due to the U.K's public holiday on Monday the IGC said the compilation of the data has been delayed by one day.</p>
<p>London Newsroom.. +44 171 542 7771</p>
</text>
